			"Message": "docs(Echo): Enhance architecture documentation with icons and external links\n\nRefine the `Documentation/GitHub/Architecture.md` file to improve readability and navigability. Add decorative icons (⚡, 📋, 🏗️, etc.) to section headers for visual scanning and apply consistent code formatting (`Echo`, `Rust`, `Mountain`, `crossbeam-deque`) throughout the text.\n\nConvert internal relative paths to external GitHub tree URLs for links to `Common`, `Mountain`, and `RustInfrastructure`. This ensures that the `Echo` repository documentation correctly points to the live `Current` branch of dependent projects on the monorepo GitHub organization.\n\nThis update aligns the visual style with the `README.md` standardization and guarantees contributors can access linked architectural docs without 404 errors.",
